BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Dev Uthani Ekadashi [verify] / देव उठनी एकाद
 शी [सत्यापित करें]
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261120
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261121
DTSTAMP:20261103T043905Z
UID:dev_uthani-2026-11-20@dharmasetu
CATEGORIES:festivals\,ekadashi
DESCRIPTION:Why: close the monsoon retreat of the gods and reopen the seas
 on of household beginnings.\n\nStory: Dev Uthani (Prabodhini) Ekadashi in 
 Kartika Shukla ends Chaturmas — Vishnu is said to awaken\; marriages and
  auspicious starts resume.\nSource: Padma Purana / Vaishnava ekadashi lore
 \nWhy: close the monsoon retreat of the gods and reopen the season of hous
 ehold beginnings.\nModern angle: Calendar bookkeeping for social life afte
 r monsoon\; cultural. Ekadashi fasting has broader metabolic research link
 s.\nEvidence: Plausible\nLink: https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC10
 894978/\nMore: https://saumya-sharma.github.io/dharmasetu/prototype/reason
 ing.html#ekadashi-fasting\nLocation basis: New Delhi. City-specific timing
  coming later.\n\n—\nदेव उठनी एकादशी [सत
 ्यापित करें]\nदेव उठनी (प्रबो
 धिनी) एकादशी कार्तिक शुक्ल —
  चातुर्मास का अंत\, विष्णु का 
 जागरण\; विवाह और शुभ आरंभ फिर 
 से।\nकारण: देवताओं के वर्षा-अ
 वकाश का समापन और गृह आरंभों 
 का मौसम फिर खोलना।
LOCATION:New Delhi\, India (reference)
