BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Ram Navami / राम नवमी
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270415
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270416
DTSTAMP:20261103T043905Z
UID:ram_navami-2027-04-15@dharmasetu
CATEGORIES:festivals\,birth-auspicious
DESCRIPTION:Why: remember a life-model of duty\, restraint and care for th
 e vulnerable at the spring new-year fortnight.\n\nStory: Ram Navami celebr
 ates the birth of Rama on Chaitra Shukla Navami — Maryada Purushottam\, 
 the ideal of dharmic kingship in the Ramayana.\nSource: Valmiki Ramayana\;
  later Puranic calendars\nWhy: remember a life-model of duty\, restraint a
 nd care for the vulnerable at the spring new-year fortnight.\nModern angle
 : Narrative ethics and community worship\; cultural meaning\, not a scient
 ific outcome claim.\nEvidence: Cultural/psychological\nMore: https://saumy
 a-sharma.github.io/dharmasetu/prototype/reasoning.html#calendar-lunisolar
 \nLocation basis: New Delhi. City-specific timing coming later.\n\n—\n
 राम नवमी\nराम नवमी चैत्र शुक
 ्ल नवमी पर राम के जन्म का उत्
 सव है — रामायण में मर्यादा प
 ुरुषोत्तम।\nकारण: वसंत नववर्
 ष पक्ष में कर्तव्य\, संयम और द
 ुर्बलों की रक्षा के जीवन-आदर
 ्श का स्मरण।
