 r whom.\n\nStory: Raksha Bandhan on Shravana Purnima ties a rakhi as a ple
 dge of protection and care between siblings and chosen kin.\nSource: Puran
 ic / regional folk\; Bhavishya Purana strands\nWhy: make care visible — 
 a thread that names who watches over whom.\nModern angle: Kinship bonding 
 and ritualised commitment\; cultural/psychological strength.\nEvidence: Cu
 ltural/psychological\nMore: https://saumya-sharma.github.io/dharmasetu/pro
 totype/reasoning.html#life-moments-tilak\nLocation basis: New Delhi. City-
 specific timing coming later.\n\n—\nरक्षाबंधन\nरक
 ्षाबंधन श्रावण पूर्णिमा पर 
