 dern angle: Community craft\, public art and shared vows\; cultural meanin
 g.\nEvidence: Cultural/psychological\nMore: https://saumya-sharma.github.i
 o/dharmasetu/prototype/reasoning.html#calendar-lunisolar\nLocation basis: 
